then the ordered vector space $\blinop {L} {M}$ of order bounded linear operators between $L$ and $M$
is a Dedekind complete vector lattice.  Moreover, if $S, T \in \blinop {L} {M}$, then
for each $x \in L_+$ we have
\begin{gather}
\label {stvee}
